From 165620eb9bc7376654b1e9dd6e4290f8655f1ca9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Techma2004 <techma@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 01:14:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix dashboard stats, teacher/HOD account creation, and
 announcement audience filtering

- dashboard.js: fix Promise.all destructuring so /api/dashboard/stats
  actually returns row values instead of arrays (was returning
  undefined for every stat due to missing nesting level).
- admin.js: fix deptRow/subjectRow destructuring in POST /admin/users.
  These were correctly unwrapped to single row objects but then
  checked with '.length' (which objects don't have), so creating a
  Teacher or HOD account always failed with 'A valid department is
  required.' Also fixed downstream deptRow[0].id / subjectRow[0].id
  references that would have crashed since these are objects, not
  arrays.
- announcements.js: add missing 'auth' middleware to GET / so
  logged-in staff are correctly identified and see announcements
  targeted at their role, instead of always falling back to the
  'student' audience.
---
 backend/routes/admin.js         | 14 +++++++-------
 backend/routes/announcements.js |  2 +-
 backend/routes/dashboard.js     |  2 +-
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

